              "text": "einweihen — \"to open officially, to inaugurate; to let in on\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Am Sonntag weihte die Stadt die neue Brücke ein. On Sunday the town officially opened the new bridge."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Separable: sie weihen ein. Also to let someone in on a secret: jemanden einweihen."
            }
          ]
        },
